{"title": "Elder", "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"druid-infobox druid-container noexcerpt\" id=\"druid-container-1\"><div><div class=\"druid-title\">Elder</div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div class=\"druid-main-image\"><div class=\"druid-main-images-labels druid-tabs\"><div class=\"druid-main-images-label druid-tab druid-toggleable druid-title-tab focused\" data-druid=\"1-1\" data-druid-tab-key=\"In-Game\">In-Game</div></div><a href=\"/wiki/File:Elder.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Elder.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/Elder.jpg/250px-Elder.jpg?5e7061\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"141\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Elder.jpg/375px-Elder.jpg?5e7061 1.5x, /images/thumb/Elder.jpg/500px-Elder.jpg?5e7061 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div data-druid-section=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-section druid-section-Information\">Information</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-VariantOf\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-VariantOf\">Variant Of</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-VariantOf druid-data-nonempty\">\nForest Keeper</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-InternalID\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-InternalID\">Internal ID</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-InternalID druid-data-nonempty\">\nElder</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-MaxCount\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-MaxCount\">Max Count</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-MaxCount druid-data-nonempty\">\n1</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-PowerLevel\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-PowerLevel\">Power Level</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-PowerLevel druid-data-nonempty\">\n3</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-CauseofDeath\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-CauseofDeath\">Cause of Death</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-CauseofDeath druid-data-nonempty\">\nCrushing, Gravity</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-IsBodyRecoverable\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-IsBodyRecoverable\">Is Body Recoverable?</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-IsBodyRecoverable druid-data-nonempty\">\nNo (Crushing), Yes (Gravity)</div></div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div data-druid-section=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-section druid-section-Stats\">Stats</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-Health\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-Health\">Health</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-Health druid-data-nonempty\">\n80</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-Damage\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-Damage\">Damage</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-Damage druid-data-nonempty\">\nInstant Kill</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-DoorSpeedMultiplier\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-DoorSpeedMultiplier\">Door Speed Multiplier</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-DoorSpeedMultiplier druid-data-nonempty\">\n1</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-StunTimeMultiplier\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-StunTimeMultiplier\">Stun Time Multiplier</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-StunTimeMultiplier druid-data-nonempty\">\n1.2</div></div></div></div>\n<p>The <b>Elder</b> is a hostile entity and variant of the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://lethal.miraheze.org/wiki/Forest_Keeper\">Forest Keeper</a> added by <b>Wesley's Ememy Variants</b>. It is a colossal humanoid figure with spikes jutting out of its body, skin resembling old tree bark, an open hole on its chest that is its mouth, and two eyes with a red layer around them.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Mechanics\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Mechanics\">&gt; Mechanics</span></h2>\n<p>Similar to the Forest Keeper, the <b>Elder</b> will roam around until spotting players, raising its suspicion meter. The distance from the <b>Elder</b>, being uncrouched, moving, and sprinting all can increase the rate at which the <b>Elder</b> becomes suspicious. Once its suspicion meter has risen high enough for that specific player, it will begin chasing them until line of sight is broken for more than 3 seconds or the player dies. It will then search around the area it last saw the player for 9 seconds before beginning to roam around again.\n</p><p>If the <b>Elder</b> grabs a player by coming into contact with them and successfully eats them, they will die and both their body and any items they were holding can not be recovered. If the <b>Elder</b> dies, its body will fall backwards and crush any player underneath it. \n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Spawn_Chance\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Spawn_Chance\">&gt; Spawn Chance</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Elder</b> exclusively spawns on <a href=\"/wiki/Roart\" title=\"Roart\"><b>Roart</b></a>, having a 73.53% chance to spawn on the exterior during daytime.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Bestiary_Entry\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Bestiary_Entry\">&gt; Bestiary Entry</span></h2>\n<p>While the entry for the <b>Elder</b> is called \"Forest Elder\", players must type it as one word or type a minimum of \"foreste\" to not be redirected to the entry for the Forest Keeper.\n</p>\n<table class=\"article-table mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" data-expandtext=\"\u25bc\" data-collapsetext=\"\u25b2\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Forest Elder <span style=\"padding-left:0.5em;\">&#x2060;</span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<table style=\"border: 15px solid #8E8E83; font-size: 135%; font-family: Tomorrow; color: #01A801; border-spacing: 0px;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 25px; background-color: #151515;\">FOREST ELDER<br /><br />Sigurd's danger level: 50%<br /><br />Scientific name: Satyrid-derceritas<br />A very close relative to the Satyrid-proceritas. The Elders are a nearly extinct subspecies which are able to grow nearly twice as tall as the Forest Keepers due to their living conditions. However it is also because of their preferred environment that they never seek to leave the dense jungles which have become increasingly rarer.<br />The Forest Elder shares a striking resemblance with its smaller counterpart. The main difference being a slightly whiter appearance and their eyes having a red protective layer against attacks from avian wildlife.<br /><br />It has been known that some tribes take the Elders as higher beings, believing they are men chosen by gods who have transformed to become the protectors of the woods they live in.<br /><br />Due to the striking similarity to the Forest keeper, read the data entry about the Forest keeper for more information on the Elder\u2019s visual and physical evolution.\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Audio\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Audio\">&gt; Audio</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noresize\">\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"text-align: center;\" data-expandtext=\"\u25bc\" data-collapsetext=\"\u25b2\">\n<caption style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">Audio\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Action</th>\n<th>Sound\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Distant Stomping</td>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"5\" data-mwtitle=\"DistantRumble1Elder.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/DistantRumble1Elder.mp3?6157f8\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/DistantRumble1Elder.mp3/DistantRumble1Elder.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio><br /><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"5\" data-mwtitle=\"DistantRumble2Elder.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/DistantRumble2Elder.mp3?b49c3a\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/DistantRumble2Elder.mp3/DistantRumble2Elder.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio><br /><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"5\" data-mwtitle=\"DistantRumble3Elder.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/DistantRumble3Elder.mp3?7f3b34\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/DistantRumble3Elder.mp3/DistantRumble3Elder.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Stomping</td>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"4\" data-mwtitle=\"GiantStomp1Elder.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/GiantStomp1Elder.mp3?e2dcd5\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/GiantStomp1Elder.mp3/GiantStomp1Elder.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio><br /><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"4\" data-mwtitle=\"GiantStomp2Elder.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/GiantStomp2Elder.mp3?b5022d\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/GiantStomp2Elder.mp3/GiantStomp2Elder.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio><br /><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"4\" data-mwtitle=\"GiantStomp3Elder.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/GiantStomp3Elder.mp3?6bb1c4\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/GiantStomp3Elder.mp3/GiantStomp3Elder.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio><br /><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"4\" data-mwtitle=\"GiantStomp4Elder.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/GiantStomp4Elder.mp3?2b34d1\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/GiantStomp4Elder.mp3/GiantStomp4Elder.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio><br /><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"4\" data-mwtitle=\"GiantStomp5Elder.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/GiantStomp5Elder.mp3?dd5e30\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/GiantStomp5Elder.mp3/GiantStomp5Elder.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Eating</td>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"7\" data-mwtitle=\"FGiantEatPlayerSFX.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/FGiantEatPlayerSFX.mp3?e70285\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/FGiantEatPlayerSFX.mp3/FGiantEatPlayerSFX.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Gallery\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Gallery\">&gt; Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-traditional\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Lethal_Company_Screenshot_2025.07.19_-_15.12.14.23.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"The Elder looking to the side at a player.\"><img alt=\"The Elder looking to the side at a player.\" src=\"/images/thumb/Lethal_Company_Screenshot_2025.07.19_-_15.12.14.23.png/120px-Lethal_Company_Screenshot_2025.07.19_-_15.12.14.23.png?2b5358\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Lethal_Company_Screenshot_2025.07.19_-_15.12.14.23.png/180px-Lethal_Company_Screenshot_2025.07.19_-_15.12.14.23.png?2b5358 1.5x, /images/thumb/Lethal_Company_Screenshot_2025.07.19_-_15.12.14.23.png/240px-Lethal_Company_Screenshot_2025.07.19_-_15.12.14.23.png?2b5358 2x\" data-file-width=\"2560\" data-file-height=\"1440\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">The Elder looking to the side at a player.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:ElderEating.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"The Elder about to eat a player.\"><img alt=\"The Elder about to eat a player.\" src=\"/images/thumb/ElderEating.jpg/120px-ElderEating.jpg?f5ad3e\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/ElderEating.jpg/180px-ElderEating.jpg?f5